<view class="page"><text class="title">协同消息，不错过。</text><block wx:if="{{context}}"><view class="intro small muted">{{context.identity.org}} · {{context.identity.label}}</view><view class="note">以下为虚构业务消息样例，不是真实通知；不发送推送、短信或消息给任何主体。</view><block wx:if="{{!selected}}"><view class="message-actions"><text class="small muted">{{unread}}条未读（演示）</text><button class="small" bindtap="readAll">当前身份全部已读</button></view><scroll-view scroll-x="{{true}}" class="message-tabs"><view class="tab-line"><button wx:for="{{categories}}" wx:key="*this" class="{{category === item ? 'active' : ''}}" data-id="{{item}}" bindtap="category">{{item}}</button></view></scroll-view><view class="surface" wx:if="{{filtered.length}}"><button wx:for="{{filtered}}" wx:key="id" class="row message-row" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="open"><view class="row-copy"><view class="message-head"><view wx:if="{{!item.read}}" class="unread-dot"/><text>{{item.title}}</text></view><view class="small muted message-summary">{{item.copy}}</view><view class="small muted">{{item.category}} · {{item.read ? '已读' : '未读'}} · {{item.date}}</view></view><view class="chevron"/></button></view><view wx:else class="empty muted">此分类下暂无消息。</view></block><view wx:else class="surface"><text class="pill">{{selected.category}} · 已读</text><text class="heading gap">{{selected.title}}</text><view class="small muted">{{selected.org}} · {{selected.role}}</view><view class="gap">{{selected.copy}}</view><button wx:if="{{selected.target}}" class="primary gap" bindtap="related">查看关联业务原型</button><button class="secondary" bindtap="back">返回消息列表</button></view></block><view wx:else class="empty"><view class="muted intro">进入演示账号后，查看当前主体与身份的业务消息样例。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="login">进入演示账号</button></view><view class="demo-foot">消息按当前身份展示 · 不含商户分账通知</view></view>
